	(generator "cm5h_fpgen")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "HOAUC HYCW11B-05NGFF-320B M.2 Key-B socket, 3.2 mm, module bottom 1.25 mm above the board. Land per HOAUC recommended PCB layout: 0.30 x 1.55 pads at 0.5 pitch, odd row at y = 0, even row at y = 7.55, support pads 1.20 x 2.75 at x = +-10.35, NPTH 1.10 / 1.60 at (-10, 5.275) / (10, 5.275). The module extends toward +y (slot on the even-row side, section A-A); 3042 module outline and standoff position on F.Fab. The courtyard covers the module; two openings behind the VCC pins (2/4 and 70/72/74, y 8.6 to 10.85) take the EM060K reference MLCC arrays (Quectel EM060K HD 3.5.2) under the module edge: parts there must be <= 0.6 mm high (module bottom 1.25 mm). The rest of the module area stays clear for the thermal pad (HD 6.7).")
